==Description==
'''Fogged Lair''' is a map created by Your_Adversary in 2022. It would be a map with two paths.

==Design & Path==
'''Fogged Lair''' takes place in a forest covered by a grey mist. A small river runs through the forest, though it has lost most of its water. The map also contains a few small pillars and an ancient temple. The forest is surrounded by a few cliffs.

The map has two paths, one on each side of the river. The path takes multiple turns, going around the cliffs and river present on the map.

